<title>SWEDEN: Kinnevik 9 mo profit falls nearly 40 pct.</title>
<headline>Kinnevik 9 mo profit falls nearly 40 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish publishing group Kinnevik results for the nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				247 vs     409*</p>
<p> Sales					 7,392 vs   6,973</p>
<p> Other operating income		    212 vs	83</p>
<p> Operating costs			   6,805 vs   5,894</p>
<p> Depreciation				  472 vs     482</p>
<p> Profit after deprec			 469 vs     681</p>
<p> Associate interests			   9 vs     127</p>
<p> Net financial items		CHARGE 324 vs     223 CHARGE</p>
<p> Interest on convertibles	 CREDIT  93 vs     176 CHARGE</p>
<p> Minorities			   CHARGE  39 vs	25 CREDIT</p>
<p> Earnings per share (SKR)		 2.64 vs   10.14</p>
<p>*=all pro forma results</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001017</p>
</text>
